                        Allende’s inaugural address, which
                    was featured in a November 8 <hi rendition="#italic">New York Times</hi>
                    article. (Juan De Onis, “Chile: Allende
                    Begins the March Toward Socialism,” <hi rendition="#italic">New York Times,</hi>
                    November 8, 1970, p. E5)</p>
            </note>
